---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About 相關" section="about">
	<section class="archive-page about-page" aria-labelledby="about-title">
		<header class="page-intro">
			<h1 id="about-title"></h1>
		</header>
		<div class="about-stream">
			<section class="about-profile">
				<h2>盧政 <span> luzheng</span></h2>
				<div class="about-reading about-profile-copy">
					<div lang="zh-Hant">
						<p>2002年，廣東省清遠市出生。樂手、作曲者、設計師。策劃和參與演出組織「晶體 Jingti#」和「狂人日報 Madman pao」。</p>
					</div>
					<div lang="en">
						<p>b. 2002, Qingyuan, Guangdong, CN.</p>
						<p>Musician, composer, and designer.</p>
						<p>Initiator and organizer of the performance projects “Jingti#” and “the madman pao”.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="about-bio">
				<h2>bio/</h2>
				<div class="about-reading">
					<div lang="zh-Hant"><p>2022開始音樂創作，涉足即興音樂、流行樂、噪音和實驗音樂。材料工具常用錄音機器、身體、閱讀器、吉他、中頻治療儀器、食物與概念，經多種形式構成音樂，於聆聽狀態中顯現自身與各界道的交會。</p></div>
					<div lang="en"><p>Since 2022, Luzheng has worked across improvised music, pop, noise, and experimental music. Live performances often bring together recording devices, the body, readers, guitar, mid-frequency therapeutic devices, food, and concepts. Music is composed through these shifting forms, making audible the intersections between the self and its surrounding worlds.</p></div>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="about-contact"><h2>contact/</h2><p><a href="mailto:luzheng0121@gmail.com">luzheng0121@gmail.com</a></p></section>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
